            0.527,
            0.806
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2.1 What Is a Cell?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.822,
            0.883,
            0.88
          ],
          "content": "All living beings are made up of **cells**. You might wonder what cells actually look like. Let us take a closer look at the basic structure of a cell using a microscope."
        },
        {
